(window.BOOK_MODULES = window.BOOK_MODULES || {})[11] = {"n": 11, "title": "Accusative Noun Roles", "ar": "المَنْصُوبَاتُ", "lessons": [{"key": "0", "title": "Introduction", "short": "Introduction", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L0-s1\">Before you begin</h2><p>Identify the relationship before choosing the ending. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span></b> is shared by several roles; a word ending in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ـًا</span></b> is not automatically <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعولًا به</span>.</p><p>This module develops twelve roles: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول المطلق، المفعول به، المفعول فيه، المفعول له، المفعول معه، الحال، التمييز، المستثنى، خبر الأفعال الناقصة، خبر الحروف المشبهة بليس، اسم الحروف المشبهة بالفعل، اسم لا لنفي الجنس</span></b>. Some members have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب محلّي</span> rather than <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب لفظي</span>; some constructions in these chapters permit <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L0-s2\">Essential tools</h2><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العامل</span></b> explains the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعمول</span></b> receives it. State both in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span></b> names an action without locating it in time: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتب</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مشتق</span></b> includes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كاتب؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جامد</span></b> includes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حجر</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة / نكرة</span></b> distinguish an identified expression from an unspecified one. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف ومضاف إليه</span></b> are two linked roles, not two words with the same <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب / مبني</span></b>: distinguish a changing ending from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> may be <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب</span></b> without a visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span>.</li><li>For the examples here, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب المفرد</span> is normally <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بالفتحة؛ نصب المثنى وجمع المذكر السالم بالياء؛ نصب جمع المؤنث السالم بالكسرة. جرّ</span> is normally <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بالكسرة</span> in the ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد</span> examples.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صريح / مؤوّل</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنْ</span> with its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> can supply a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر مؤوّل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span></b> is evidence from wording or context; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span></b> supplies understood wording.</li></ul><p>Work through the guided questions before the independent ones. Later passages omit most vowel marks. Each choice or table row has one correct answer. Where several analyses are valid, the question specifies the one to use. Read the Arabic aloud and attempt the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> before selecting an answer.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L0-s1", "title": "Before you begin"}, {"id": "L0-s2", "title": "Essential tools"}], "items": []}, {"key": "1", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول المطلق</span>", "short": "Lesson 1", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s1\">Core rule and vocabulary</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول المطلق</span></b> expresses the action itself through a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> of its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>, or a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> with the same meaning. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رَتِّلِ القُرْآنَ تَرْتِيلًا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ترتيلًا</span> expresses the reciting; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القرآنَ</span> identifies what is recited. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> may be <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل، مصدر، مشتق</span></b>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فإنّ جهنّم جزاؤكم جزاءً موفورًا</span></b>, one analysis makes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزاؤكم</span> the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزاءً</span>; another supplies a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوف فعل</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span></b> reinforces; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نوع</span></b> identifies how the action occurs; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span></b> counts its occurrences.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Purpose</th><th>Example</th><th>Evidence</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للتوكيد</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَجَدَ سُجُودًا</span></td><td>Bare <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span>, without further <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للنوع</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَارَ سَيْرًا سَرِيعًا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة</span> specifies the manner</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للنوع</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَارَ سَيْرَ الحُكَمَاءِ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> specifies the manner</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للعدد</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَجَدَ سَجْدَتَيْنِ</span></td><td>Two occurrences</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The bare <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر للتوكيد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>, neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصوف</span> nor <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>, and has neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء الوحدة</span> nor <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة مثنى</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع. مصدر العدد</span> permits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تثنية وجمع</span>; do not transfer this counting rule to the other two kinds. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النوع</span> can also be specified by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إشارة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل للعهد</span> (<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اجتهد الاجتهاد</span></b>: the previously identified effort).</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s2\">What can stand in its place?</h2><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب عن المصدر</span></th><th>Example and interpretation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم المصدر</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نتوضّأ وضوءَ رسولِ الله: وضوء</span> names the action without the full form of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توضّؤ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة المصدر</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اذكرْ ربَّك كثيرًا: ذكرًا كثيرًا</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير المصدر</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعذّبه عذابًا لا أعذّبه أحدًا</span>: the final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاء</span> refers to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عذاب</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إشارة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اجتهد ذلك الاجتهاد: ذلك</span> points to the specified action</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما يدل على العدد</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلّى خمسَ مرّاتٍ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما يدل على النوع</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجع القهقرى</span>: returned backwards</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلّ، بعض، أيّ مضافة إلى المصدر</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلَّ البسطِ؛ بعضَ السعيِ؛ أيَّ منقلبٍ ينقلبون</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> can also stand for its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إحسانًا</span></b> for a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صبرًا لا جزعًا</span></b> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر ونهي؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بُعدًا</span></b> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دعاء؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حقًّا</span></b> to reinforce the preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فإمّا منًّا بعدُ وإمّا فداءً</span></b> to detail the possible outcomes. Established expressions include <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سبحانك، معاذ الله، حجرًا محجورًا، لبّيك، غفرانك</span></b>. Recover the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> from meaning; do not invent new fixed expressions by analogy.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَجَدَ خَالِدٌ سَجْدَتَيْنِ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Khalid prostrated twice.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سجد: فعل ماض مبني على الفتح</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ: فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سجدتين: مفعول مطلق للعدد منصوب بالياء لأنه مثنى؛ النون عوض عن التنوين في المفرد</span>.</li></ul></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L1-s1", "title": "Core rule and vocabulary"}, {"id": "L1-s2", "title": "What can stand in its place?"}, {"id": "L1-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "1G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the purpose of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول المطلق</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سجودًا</span> is a bare <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر؛ سريعًا</span> specifies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نوع</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سيرًا؛ سجدتين</span> counts two occurrences and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بالياء</span>.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سجد سجودًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للنوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للعدد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للتوكيد</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سار سيرًا سريعًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للعدد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للنوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للتوكيد فقط</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سجد سجدتين</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للعدد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للنوع فقط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للتوكيد فقط</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "1G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيتُ بعضَ السعيِ</span></b>, what receives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعضَ</span> stands in place of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب؛ السعيِ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور</span>. The two words have different relationships.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "opts": ["Both words must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعضَ: نائب عن المصدر، وهو مضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">السعيَ: مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "1I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ركعَ المصلّي <span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b> to express exactly two occurrences.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ركعتينِ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق للعدد منصوب بالياء لأنه مثنى. ركوعًا</span> alone reinforces the action without specifying two.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ركوعٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ركعتينِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ركوعًا</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "1I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct: “Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر منصوب</span> reinforces its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> without adding information.”", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سيرًا سريعًا</span> specifies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نوع</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سجدتين</span> specifies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد. مصدر</span> is a form; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول المطلق</span> is a relationship.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "opts": ["A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> cannot be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span>.", "Correct: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل مصدر منصوب للتوكيد</span>.", "It may specify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نوع</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span>, or fill a different role according to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "1R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ الكتابَ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ قراءةً</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span> is what was read; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءة</span> expresses the action itself. Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بالفتحة</span>.</p>", "group": "1R|Review", "opts": ["Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>", "Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ مفعول به؛ قراءةً مفعول مطلق</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "1-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد ينوب عن المصدر ما يدلّ على عدده أو نوعه</span>.</b> Apply this to <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلّى خمسَ مرّاتٍ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خمسَ نائب عن المصدر منصوب، وهو مضاف؛ مرّاتٍ مضاف إليه مجرور</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span> counts occurrences of prayer.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خمسَ</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلّى</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرّاتٍ</span> must become <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرّاتًا</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خمسَ</span> stands in place of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> and indicates <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span>."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول به</span> and its position", "short": "Lesson 2", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s1\">Core rule</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول به</span></b> is what the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> bears upon: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَرَأَ خَالِدٌ الكِتَابَ</span></b>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> can itself be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعولًا به</span> when this is its relationship: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أُحِبُّ القِرَاءَةَ</span></b>. Meaning and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> determine the role, not word formation alone.</p><p>The ordinary order is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل، فاعل، مفعول به</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديم المفعول به على الفعل</span> may be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جائزًا</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إيّاك نعبد</span></b>. It is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واجب</span> when the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول</span> has <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صدر الكلام</span></b>, as with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم استفهام</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ كتابٍ قرأتَ؟ أيًّا تدعُ يَسْمَعْ</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم الخبرية</span></b> also has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صدر الكلام</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وكم أرسلنا من نبيٍّ</span></b>.</p><p>Recall that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديم المفعول به على الفاعل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديمه على الفعل</span> are different questions. An attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> or a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> reference can constrain the internal order even where the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> stays first.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَيَّ كِتَابٍ قَرَأْتَ؟</span></b> <span class=\"gl\">Which book did you read?</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ: اسم استفهام، مفعول به مقدّم وجوبًا، منصوب بالفتحة، وهو مضاف</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٍ: مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتَ: قرأ فعل ماض مبني على السكون لاتصاله بتاء الفاعل؛ التاء ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>.</li></ul><p>Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُه</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء ضمير متصل في محل نصب مفعول به</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> even though the pronounced <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاء</span> is not marked with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L2-s1", "title": "Core rule"}, {"id": "L2-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "2G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete the relationships in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ رسالةٍ كتبتَ؟</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ اسم استفهام له صدر الكلام، منصوب بكتبت؛ رسالةٍ مضاف إليه. كتبت فعل ماض والتاء فاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به مقدّم وجوبًا، وهو مضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف استفهام لا محل له</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسالةٍ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف تأنيث</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "2G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إيّاك</span></b> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إيّاك نعبد</span></b> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إيّاك</span> fills the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> relationship with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعبد</span>. Position before the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> does not make it <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعلًا</span>.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به مقدّم لنعبد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لأنّه جاء أولًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه بلا مضاف</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "2I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the ending in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حفظتُ القصيدة<span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حفظتُ</span> already contains its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء. القصيدةَ</span> names what was memorised, so it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القصيدةُ: فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القصيدةَ: مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القصيدةِ: مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "2I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحبّ القراءةَ</span></b>, identify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القراءة</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القراءةَ</span> is what is loved. It is not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحبّ</span> or a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> with the same meaning, so it is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول المطلق</span> here.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لأحبّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به، مع كونها مصدرًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق لأحبّ لمجرّد كونها مصدرًا</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "2R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ كتابٍ قرأتَ قراءةً دقيقةً؟</span></b>, compare <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءة</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span> identifies what was read and has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صدر الكلام؛ قراءةً دقيقةً</span> specifies the kind of reading. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٍ</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "2R|Review", "opts": ["Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف زمان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ مفعول به؛ قراءة مفعول مطلق للنوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ مفعول مطلق؛ قراءة فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "2-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأصل في المفعول به أن يكون بعد الفعل والفاعل</span>.</b> Does this rule forbid <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ كتابٍ قرأتَ؟</span></b>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأصل</span> gives the ordinary order. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صدر الكلام</span> is a stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> requiring a different order.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["Yes: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span> cannot be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعولًا به</span>.", "Yes: move <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأت</span> in this question.", "No: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاستفهام</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديم أيّ</span> here."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول فيه</span>", "short": "Lesson 3", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s1\">Core rule and terminology</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول فيه</span></b> identifies when or where the action occurs; it is also called <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span></b>. Distinguish <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف زمان / ظرف مكان</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبهم / محدود</span></b>. Here <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبهم</span> lacks a specified time or place; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محدود</span> specifies it. A duration such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يوم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محدود</span> even without naming a calendar date.</p><p>In this analysis, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب الظرف</span> involves <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر مقدّر</span></b>; an expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ</span>. Do not say that a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر ظاهر</span> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Kind</th><th>Examples</th><th>Pattern</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زمان مبهم</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حين، وقت، أبد</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">انتظرتُ حينًا / إلى حينٍ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زمان محدود</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساعة، يوم، ليلة، أسبوع، شهر، سنة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سافرتُ يومَ الجمعةِ / في يومِ الجمعةِ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكان مبهم</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمام، خلف، فوق، تحت، يمين، شمال؛ ميل، فرسخ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جلستُ خلفَ البابِ / من خلفِ البابِ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكان محدود</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأرض، المدينة</span></td><td>Normally use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر ظاهر: جلستُ في المدينةِ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكان محدود</span> permits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> with a place expression <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مشتق</span> from the relevant <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> and with specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span> of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدخول، السكون، النزول</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دخل الجنةَ؛ اسكن الجنةَ؛ نزل المدينةَ</span></b>. Use the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول فيه</span> analysis here; do not extend these permissions to every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> and every named place.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s2\">Expressions that stand in place of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span></h2><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> can indicate a time: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إدبارَ النجومِ</span></b> means the time when the stars withdraw. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> to a time expression can stand in its place: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لبثتُ بعضَ يومٍ</span></b>. A number can do so: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثَ ليالٍ</span></b>. The following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> is then <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>, not another <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> merely because it names time.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جَلَسَ سَعِيدٌ خَلْفَ البَابِ سَاعَةً</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Saʿid sat behind the door for an hour.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جلس: فعل ماض؛ سعيدٌ: فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلفَ: مفعول فيه، ظرف مكان منصوب بالفتحة، متعلق بجلس، وهو مضاف</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البابِ: مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساعةً: مفعول فيه، ظرف زمان منصوب بالفتحة، متعلق بجلس</span>.</li></ul></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L3-s1", "title": "Core rule and terminology"}, {"id": "L3-s2", "title": "Expressions that stand in place of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span>"}, {"id": "L3-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "3G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each expression to its classification here.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حين</span> names an unspecified time; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يوم</span> a defined time unit; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلف</span> a direction. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في المدينة</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ</span> from the expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span>.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حينًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مكان محدود</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول معه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف زمان مبهم</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يومَ الجمعةِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف زمان محدود</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مكان مبهم</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلفَ البابِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف زمان محدود</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مكان مبهم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز عدد</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في المدينةِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر واسم مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المدينةَ منصوب بفي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "3G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لبثتُ بعضَ يومٍ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعضَ</span> stands in place of the time expression and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بالفتحة؛ يومٍ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالإضافة. لبثتُ</span> supplies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل وفاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به في محل نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل في محل رفع</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعضَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب عن ظرف الزمان منصوب، وهو مضاف</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يومٍ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف منصوب بالكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "3I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وقفتُ أمامَ <span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b> using <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باب</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمامَ ظرف مكان منصوب وهو مضاف؛ البابِ مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>. Do not copy the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمام</span> onto <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباب</span>.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البابِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البابُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البابَ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "3I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which statement correctly applies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكان محدود</span> rule?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النزول</span> is one of the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span> allowing this analysis. With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جلس</span> use an appropriate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>, as in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جلست في المدينة</span>.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "opts": ["Every place <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> after every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مدينة</span> can never occur with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نزل المدينةَ</span> is licensed here; this does not license <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جلستُ المدينةَ</span> by the same rule."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "3R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سار ميلًا وسار سيرًا سريعًا</span></b>, distinguish <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ميلًا</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سيرًا</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ميل</span> is a distance expression classed with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكان مبهم. سيرًا سريعًا</span> specifies the kind of the action, not the distance.</p>", "group": "3R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ميلًا حال؛ سيرًا مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ميلًا ظرف مكان؛ سيرًا مفعول مطلق للنوع</span>", "Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "3-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول فيه ما وقع فيه الفعل من الزمان أو المكان</span>.</b> Which word fits in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">انتظر خالدٌ ساعةً</span></b>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساعةً</span> specifies the time occupied by waiting and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف زمان منصوب. خالدٌ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساعةً</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">انتظر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "4", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول له</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول معه</span>", "short": "Lesson 4", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s1\">Why did it happen?</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول له</span></b> or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول لأجله</span></b> gives the reason for the action: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قُمْتُ إِكْرَامًا لِلْمُعَلِّمِ</span></b>. For <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span>, four <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> are needed: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر، قلبي، اتحاد الفاعل، اتحاد الزمن</span></b>. The reason must be a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> expressing an inward motive; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> and time must match those of the action.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Missing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span></th><th>Keep <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأرض وضعها للأنام: الأنام</span> names people</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلبي</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سافرتُ للحجّ: الحجّ</span> is an outward activity</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اتحاد الفاعل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خُلقت الخيل لتركبوها</span>: creating and riding have different <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعلان</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اتحاد الزمن</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أرحمُ والدي كبيرًا لرحمته إيّاي صغيرًا</span>: present kindness recalls earlier kindness</td></tr></tbody></table><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر مؤوّل</span> can give the reason with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف مقدّر</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن تميد بكم</span></b> can mean <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كراهةَ أن تميد بكم</span></b>. An alternative <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> uses <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألّا تميد بكم</span></b>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لتركبوها وزينةً</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زينةً</span> can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعولًا له معطوفًا على محل لتركبوها</span>, or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعولًا مطلقًا</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير تتزيّنوا بها زينةً</span>. These are alternative analyses, not simultaneous roles.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s2\">With what did it happen?</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول معه</span></b> follows <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو المعية</span></b>, after a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> containing a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه فعل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سِرْتُ وَالنَّهْرَ؛ أَنَا سَائِرٌ وَالنَّهْرَ</span></b>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> explicitly states accompaniment. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء زيدٌ وعمروٌ</span></b> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span> and does not by itself establish that they arrived together; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء زيدٌ وعمرًا</span></b> explicitly states <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معية</span>.</p><p>Where <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span> is invalid, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب المفعول معه</span> is required. In the adopted account, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بُعثتُ والساعةَ كهاتين</span></b> does not coordinate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الساعة</span> with the attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> without reinforcement; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بُعثتُ أنا والساعةُ</span></b> supplies that reinforcement. Where <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span> is valid, both analyses are possible: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر الأبُ وولدُه / وولدَه</span></b>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلُّ امرئٍ وشأنُه</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير مقترنان</span>, not an automatic <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول معه</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلَّ امرئٍ وشأنَه</span></b> can instead have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير اترك</span>. Fixed patterns such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما أنت وزيدًا؟ كيف أنت وزيدًا؟</span></b> recover an omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكون</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصنع</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سِرْتُ وَالنَّهْرَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I walked alongside the river.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سرتُ: فعل ماض مبني على السكون؛ التاء في محل رفع فاعل</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو: واو المعية؛ النهرَ: مفعول معه منصوب بالفتحة</span>. The river did not walk.</li></ul><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قمتُ إكرامًا للمعلّمِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قمت فعل وفاعل؛ إكرامًا مفعول له منصوب،</span> with an inward motive accompanying my action<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ اللام حرف جر، المعلّم مجرور</span>. Do not analyse <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إكرامًا</span> as the person honoured.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L4-s1", "title": "Why did it happen?"}, {"id": "L4-s2", "title": "With what did it happen?"}, {"id": "L4-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "4G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the expression to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> or relationship.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إكرامًا</span> can express the simultaneous inward motive of the same person. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحجّ</span> is an outward activity, so retain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام. النهرَ</span> accompanies the walking without itself walking.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قمتُ إكرامًا للمعلّم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زمان مختلف بالضرورة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول معه بعد واو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر قلبي مع اتحاد الفاعل والزمن</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سافرتُ للحجّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحجّ فاعل سافرت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام لأن الحجّ ليس مصدرًا قلبيًّا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حجّ منصوب باللام</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سرتُ والنهرَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النهر فاعل ثان يسير</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول معه بعد واو المعية</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "4G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعية</span></b> explicitly in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر الأبُ وولد<span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ولدَه</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول معه منصوب؛ الهاء مضاف إليه. ولدُه</span> would be valid <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span> but is not the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معية</span> analysis.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ولدُه: مفعول معه مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ولدَه: مفعول معه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ولدِه: مجرور بالواو</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "4I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why retain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أرحم والدي لرحمته إيّاي صغيرًا</span></b> when referring to his earlier kindness?", "sol": "<p>Present kindness and past kindness do not share <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زمن</span>. This alone prevents applying the direct <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> rule for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول له</span> here.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "opts": ["The time of the two actions differs.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> makes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رحمة مرفوعًا</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رحمة</span> cannot be a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "4I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct: “Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">و</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول معه</span>.”", "sol": "<p>Compare <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سرت والنهرَ</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلّ امرئ وشأنُه</span>. Mere adjacency to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">و</span> does not establish <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعية</span> construction.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول معه</span> must always be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span>.", "Correct: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span> always assigns <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول معه</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو المعية</span> and a preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه فعل</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "4R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سرتُ ساعةً والنهرَ</span></b>, what are the two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوبان</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساعةً</span> supplies duration; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النهرَ</span> supplies accompaniment after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو المعية</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span>.</p>", "group": "4R|Review", "opts": ["Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساعةً مفعول فيه؛ النهرَ مفعول معه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساعةً مفعول له؛ النهرَ مفعول مطلق</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "4-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يشترط أن تكون قبله جملة فيها فعل أو شبه فعل</span>.</b> Which <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثال</span> meets this for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول معه</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سائرٌ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه فعل</span> within <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنا سائرٌ</span>. The stated reading of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل امرئ وشأنه</span> has no such expressed governing expression.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلُّ امرئٍ وشأنُه</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقترنان</span> understood", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النهرُ واسعٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنا سائرٌ والنهرَ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "5", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب الحال</span>", "short": "Lesson 5", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s1\">Core rule</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال</span></b> describes the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هيئة</span> of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل، مفعول به</span> or another expression. That expression is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب الحال</span></b> or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو الحال</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جَاءَ خَالِدٌ رَاكِبًا</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب الحال؛ راكبًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال. الحال</span> may also describe a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> that is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلى الله مرجعكم جميعًا</span></b>.</p><p>The ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب الحال</span> precedes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال</span> and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span> normally needs a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسوّغ</span></b>, a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> licensing this use.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسوّغ</span></th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديم الحال</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ راكبًا رجلًا: راكبًا</span> describes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلًا</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة غير محضة</span>, restricted by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فيها يفرق كلُّ أمرٍ حكيمٍ أمرًا من عندنا</span></td></tr><tr><td>After <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وما أهلكنا من قريةٍ إلّا ولها كتابٌ معلومٌ</span></td></tr><tr><td>After <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نهي</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يصلّينّ أحدٌ غافلًا</span></td></tr><tr><td>After <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هل صلّى أحدٌ جالسًا؟</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال</span> joined with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرّ على قريةٍ وهي خاويةٌ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span> without a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسوّغ</span> occurs rarely: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلّى وراءه رجالٌ قيامًا</span></b>. Recognise this established possibility without making it the default pattern.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s2\">Form and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> structure</h2><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال</span> is normally <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وحده</span></b> is interpreted as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منفردًا</span></b> or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّدًا</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال المفرد</span> is normally <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مشتق</span>; here <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد</span> means neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> nor <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span>, not necessarily a single person: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاؤوا راكبين</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال مفرد</span>.</p><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب حال</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالدٌ وهو يضحكُ</span></b>. Identify its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رابط</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب الحال</span>: here <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالدٌ يضحكُ</span></b>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر هو</span> links <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يضحك</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>. Keep the internal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مرفوعًا</span> while giving the whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة محل نصب</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رَأَيْتُ خَالِدًا رَاكِبًا</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I saw Khalid riding. Take <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راكبًا</span> as describing Khalid.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ: فعل ماض مبني على السكون؛ التاء في محل رفع فاعل</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا: مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة، وهو صاحب الحال</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راكبًا: حال منصوب بالفتحة، عامله رأيت</span>.</li></ul><p>Without context, some <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال</span> expressions could describe more than one participant. Our questions identify the intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب الحال</span> when needed.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L5-s1", "title": "Core rule"}, {"id": "L5-s2", "title": "Form and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> structure"}, {"id": "L5-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "5G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ خالدًا راكبًا</span></b>, take <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راكبًا</span> as describing Khalid.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span> is the person seen and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب الحال</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راكبًا</span> describes his <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هيئة</span>. Both receive <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> but have different roles.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال وفاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به وصاحب الحال</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راكبًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مؤخّر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل الحال</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد وحده</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الابتداء</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "5G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "What licenses the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة صاحب الحال</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هل صلّى أحدٌ جالسًا؟</span></b>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسوّغ</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب الحال</span> to be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة. أحدٌ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل وصاحب الحال</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جالسًا حال منصوب</span>.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سبق الاستفهام</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جالسًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحد</span> is always <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "5I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بقريةٍ وهي خاليةٌ</span></b>, which stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسوّغ</span> licenses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرية</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قريةٍ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وهي خاليةٌ</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة حالية</span> joined with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو. هي</span> also links the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرية</span>.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرية</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بقرية</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اقتران الحال بالواو</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "5I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the analysis of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء سعيدٌ يبتسمُ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يبتسم مضارع مرفوع، فاعله مستتر هو؛</span> the whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب حال</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> links it to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيد</span>.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة يبتسم في محل نصب حال؛ يبتسم نفسه مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يبتسمَ منصوب لأن كل حال له فتحة</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "5R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالدٌ صباحًا راكبًا</span></b>, distinguish the two descriptions.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صباحًا</span> tells when <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء</span> occurred. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راكبًا</span> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هيئة خالد</span> at that time; both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بالفتحة</span>.</p>", "group": "5R|Review", "opts": ["Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صباحًا حال؛ راكبًا ظرف مكان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صباحًا ظرف زمان؛ راكبًا حال من خالد</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "5-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأصل في الحال أن تكون نكرة، وفي صاحبها أن يكون معرفة</span>.</b> Choose the ordinary pattern.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل؛ متعبًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>. The roles and endings match the ordinary construction.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصل خالدٌ متعبًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصل خالدًا متعبٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصل رجلٌ المتعبَ</span> as the ordinary pattern"], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "6", "title": "Distinctions within <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال</span>", "short": "Lesson 6", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s1\">When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جامدة</span></h2><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال جامدة</span> may be interpreted through a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مشتق</span>:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Meaning</th><th>Example</th><th>Interpretation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تشبيه</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدا وجهُه قمرًا</span></td><td>resembling a moon</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفاعلة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعتُه يدًا بيدٍ؛ كلّمتُه فاه إلى فيَّ</span></td><td>exchanging directly; speaking face to face</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ترتيب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفًّا صفًّا</span></td><td>arranged in successive rows</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Other <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال جامدة</span> uses need no such <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأويل</span>: a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصوفة</span> expression (<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرآنًا عربيًّا</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال موطّئة</span>), a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span> (<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أربعين ليلةً</span></b> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتمّ ميقات ربّه أربعين ليلةً</span>), an original material (<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلقتَ طينًا</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديره خلقته طينًا</span>), or a resulting form. Follow these stated analyses; appearance alone does not choose a role in a new <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s2\">Separate questions, separate classifications</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Question</th><th>Terms and examples</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Does the state change?</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متَنقّلة: جاء راكبًا؛ لازمة، ثابتة، دائمة: خُلق الإنسان ضعيفًا</span></td></tr><tr><td>Does it add a distinct meaning?</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤسِّسة، مبيّنة: لا تمش في الأرض مرحًا؛ مؤكِّدة: لا تعثوا في الأرض مفسدين</span>, taking <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعثوا</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفسدوا</span></td></tr><tr><td>When does the state apply?</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محكيّة: وقد بلغني الكبر</span>, a preceding state<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ مقارنة: جاؤوا يبكون؛ مقدّرة: ادخلوها خالدين</span>, looking ahead to permanence</td></tr><tr><td>Is it itself intended, or a preparation for its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة</span>?</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقصودة: جاؤوا يبكون؛ موطّئة: قرآنًا عربيًّا</span></td></tr><tr><td>What does it describe?</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حقيقية</span>: the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب نفسه؛ سببية</span>: something related to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب</span>, as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خشّعًا أبصارهم</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>These labels can overlap because they answer different questions. For <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تعثوا ... مفسدين</span></b>, an alternative meaning “do not persist in wrongdoing” makes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفسدين</span> add information; that account prefers <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأسيس</span> over <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span>. a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span> about this example must specify the meaning adopted.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s3\">Multiple <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحوال</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مترادفة</span></b> share one <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُحشر الناس حفاةً عراةً غرلًا</span></b>. Here <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مترادفة</span> does not mean that the words are synonyms. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متداخلة</span></b> means that the second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> describes a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> within the first: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدين فيها لا يخفّف عنهم العذاب</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يخفّف</span>... describes the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير المستتر</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدين</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جَاءَ خَالِدٌ يَضْحَكُ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Khalid came laughing.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء: فعل ماض؛ خالدٌ: فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يضحكُ: فعل مضارع مرفوع بالضمة؛ فاعله ضمير مستتر تقديره هو يعود إلى خالد</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة يضحك: في محل نصب حال؛ الرابط هو الضمير المستتر</span>. It is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقارنة، متَنقّلة، مؤسِّسة، مقصودة، حقيقية</span> under the ordinary reading.</li></ul></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L6-s1", "title": "When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جامدة</span>"}, {"id": "L6-s2", "title": "Separate questions, separate classifications"}, {"id": "L6-s3", "title": "Multiple <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحوال</span>"}, {"id": "L6-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "6G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each specified reading to its label.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضعيفًا</span> gives a lasting <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدين</span> looks ahead. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرآنًا</span> prepares for the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة عربيًّا. قمرًا</span> describes resemblance, not the literal identity of the face.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خُلق الإنسان ضعيفًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال مقدّرة بالضرورة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال لازمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول معه</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ادخلوها خالدين</span>: permanence lies ahead", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال محكيّة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز مفرد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال مقدّرة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرآنًا عربيًّا: قرآنًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مصدري</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال موطّئة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدا وجهه قمرًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال جامدة مؤوّلة بمشتق للتشبيه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف زمان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول له قلبي</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "6G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why can <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متنقّلة</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤسِّسة</span></b> both describe one <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>?", "sol": "<p>A temporary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> can also add new information. These classifications are not mutually exclusive lists of roles.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "opts": ["They answer different questions: stability and added meaning.", "They are opposite labels on the same scale.", "A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> can have only one classification."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "6I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Take both descriptions of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عاد المسافرُ متعبًا جائعًا</span></b> as directly describing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسافر</span>. What are they?", "sol": "<p>Both share <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسافر</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب الحال</span>, so they are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مترادفتان</span>. The word here does not mean that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جائع</span> are synonyms.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حالان متداخلتان لأنّهما متجاورتان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعولان به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حالان مترادفتان</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "6I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "For <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تعثوا في الأرض مفسدين</span></b>, adopt <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعثوا بمعنى تفسدوا</span>. Classify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفسدين</span>.", "sol": "<p>On the stated meaning, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفسدين</span> reinforces the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>. The alternative “persist in wrongdoing” can support <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأسيس</span>; it is not the reading requested.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال موطّئة جامدة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مكان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال مؤكّدة</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "6R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct: “<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال مفرد</span> means a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> describing exactly one person.”", "sol": "<p>Number of people is not the distinction. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاؤوا راكبين</span> contains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال مفرد منصوب بالياء لأنه جمع مذكر سالم</span>.</p>", "group": "6R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد</span> here excludes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة وشبه جملة</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راكبين</span> can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حالًا مفردًا</span>.", "Correct: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راكبين</span> cannot be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حالًا</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد</span> here means <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "6-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال المتداخلة حال من ضمير في الحال الأولى</span>.</b> In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدين فيها لا يخفّف عنهم العذاب</span></b>, what is the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب</span> of the second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>?", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة لا يخفّف عنهم العذاب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> from the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> inside <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدين</span>. This nested relationship is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تداخل</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضمير المستتر في خالدين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العذاب باعتباره صاحب الحال الأولى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلمة فيها باعتبارها فاعلًا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "7", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التمييز</span> and what it clarifies", "short": "Lesson 7", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s1\">Core rule and vocabulary</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التمييز</span></b> removes <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إبهام</span></b>, uncertainty about either a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد</span></b> or a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نسبة</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عندي لترٌ لبنًا</span></b> tells us what the litre contains. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اشتعل الرأسُ شيبًا</span></b> tells us in what respect the head is described as blazing. It is normally <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز مفرد</span></th><th>What needs clarification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد صريح أو مبهم</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحد عشر كوكبًا؛ كم يومًا؟</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدار: كيل، وزن، مساحة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لترٌ لبنًا؛ مثقال ذرّةٍ خيرًا؛ جريبٌ نخلًا</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه مقدار</span>, without measurement by an instrument</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قدرُ راحةٍ سحابًا</span>: a palm-sized amount of cloud</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما أُجري مجرى المقادير</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمثله مددًا</span></td></tr><tr><td>Something made from the material named</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خاتمٌ فضّةً</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> is more usual: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خاتمُ فضّةٍ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز جملة: نسبة مبهمة</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محوّل</span></b> means that a role in an explanatory underlying wording is restated as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير محوّل</span></b> has no such reconstruction: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لله درّه فارسًا</span></b>, an expression of admiration, has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فارسًا</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز غير محوّل</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Type</th><th>Expression</th><th>Explanatory reconstruction</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محوّل عن الفاعل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اشتعل الرأسُ شيبًا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اشتعل شيبُ الرأسِ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محوّل عن المفعول به</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فجّرنا الأرضَ عيونًا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فجّرنا عيونَ الأرضِ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محوّل عن المبتدأ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنا أكثرُ منك مالًا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مالي أكثرُ من مالك</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محوّل عمّا في حكم المبتدأ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وكان الإنسان أكثرَ شيءٍ جدلًا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جدلُ الإنسان أكثرُ شيءٍ فيه</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>These <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديرات</span> explain the relationship; the expressed word remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييزًا</span>. Do not label <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شيبًا</span> as the expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اشتعل</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اشْتَعَلَ الرَّأْسُ شَيْبًا</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">The head blazed with grey hair.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اشتعل: فعل ماض مبني على الفتح</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرأسُ: فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شيبًا: تمييز منصوب بالفتحة، تمييز نسبة محوّل عن الفاعل</span>.</li></ul><p>Contrast <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالد راكبًا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راكبًا</span> describes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هيئة خالد</span>, so it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال. شيبًا</span> clarifies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نسبة</span>, so it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span>. Both can have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> without sharing a role.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L7-s1", "title": "Core rule and vocabulary"}, {"id": "L7-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز جملة: نسبة مبهمة</span>"}, {"id": "L7-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "7G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Identify what the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span> clarifies.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لبنًا</span> clarifies the measured material. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شيبًا</span> relates to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شيب الرأس؛ مالًا</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مالي أكثر من مالك</span>.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لترٌ لبنًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد: مقدار</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هيئة صاحب الحال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نسبة محوّلة عن المبتدأ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اشتعل الرأس شيبًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد صريح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نسبة: محوّل عن الفاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول معه</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنا أكثر منك مالًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نسبة: محوّل عن المبتدأ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مكان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "7G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the explanatory reconstruction for <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فجّرنا الأرضَ عيونًا</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عيونًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز محوّل عن المفعول به: عيون الأرض</span>. In the actual wording <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأرضَ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عيونًا تمييز</span>.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فجّرنا عيونَ الأرضِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فجّرت الأرضُ إيّانا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كانت الأرضُ فاعلًا لفجّرنا</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "7I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سليمٌ أكثرُ من أخيه علمًا</span></b>, what is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علمًا</span>?", "sol": "<p>The relationship can be explained as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علم سليم أكثر من علم أخيه</span>. No <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> of arrival or expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> governing a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> occurs.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز نسبة محوّل عن المبتدأ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال يصف هيئة سليم عند المجيء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لفعل ظاهر</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "7I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خاتمُ فضّةً</span></b> to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> form taught here.", "sol": "<p>In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة, خاتمُ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فضّةٍ مضاف إليه. خاتمٌ فضّةً</span> would instead use the taught <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span> form, but is not the requested <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خاتمُ فضّةٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خاتمِ فضّةُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خاتمٌ فضّةٍ</span> with no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "7R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عاد الطفلُ مسرورًا</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اشتعل الرأسُ شيبًا</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسرورًا</span> describes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هيئة الطفل؛ شيبًا</span> clarifies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نسبة</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اشتعل</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرأس</span>. Shared <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> does not settle the role.</p>", "group": "7R|Review", "opts": ["Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسرورًا حال؛ شيبًا تمييز</span>", "Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "7-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التمييز يرفع الإبهام</span>.</b> What does <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يرفع</span> mean here?", "sol": "<p>This is a statement about clarification of meaning, not a rule requiring <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع التمييز</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يزيل</span>: removes the uncertainty", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجعل التمييز مرفوعًا دائمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يحذف العامل من الجملة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "8", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز العدد</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم</span>", "short": "Lesson 8", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s1\">Endings depend on the construction</h2><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التمييز</span> is grouped with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المنصوبات</span> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> is frequent, not universal. For the number constructions below:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Number</th><th>Form of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التمييز</span></th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثة إلى عشرة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع مجرور بالإضافة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثةُ أيامٍ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحد عشر إلى تسعة وتسعين</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد منصوب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحدَ عشرَ كوكبًا؛ عشرون كتابًا</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائة وألف</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد مجرور بالإضافة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائةُ عامٍ؛ ألفُ سنةٍ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Do not invent a separate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واحد</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثنان</span> from this table. Detailed formation and agreement of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأعداد</span> can be learned separately; here keep the supplied <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span> and choose its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم الاستفهامية</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم الخبرية</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم الاستفهامية</span></b> asks for a number: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم يومًا لبثتَ؟</span></b> Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span> here is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد منصوب</span>. It may be omitted with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم لبثتم؟</span></b> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يومًا</span> understood.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم الخبرية</span></b> states abundance: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم من فئةٍ قليلةٍ غلبت فئةً كثيرةً</span></b>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بمن الزائدة</span>, expressed or understood in the adopted account: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم كتابٍ قرأتُ</span></b> means “many a book I have read.” Normally the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد، نكرة، متصل بكم</span>. It may also be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمعًا</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span> or separated from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم</span>. When separated, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من الظاهرة</span></b> is required: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم أهلكنا قبلهم من القرونِ</span></b>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span> can license omission, as when “many times” is understood.</p><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التمييز</span> may reinforce rather than resolve a fresh uncertainty: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ عدّة الشهور عند الله اثنا عشر شهرًا</span></b> already mentions <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشهور. شهرًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز مؤكّد</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَرَأْتُ عِشْرِينَ كِتَابًا</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I read twenty books.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ: فعل ماض، والتاء فاعل</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرين: مفعول به منصوب بالياء، من ألفاظ العقود الملحقة بجمع المذكر السالم</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا: تمييز منصوب بالفتحة، مفرد نكرة. عشرين</span> is what <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأت</span> governs directly; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا</span> clarifies its count.</li></ul></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L8-s1", "title": "Endings depend on the construction"}, {"id": "L8-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم الاستفهامية</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم الخبرية</span>"}, {"id": "L8-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "8G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the supplied <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span> with its correctly formed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span>.", "sol": "<p>3–10 take <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمعًا مجرورًا بالإضافة؛</span> 20 takes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفردًا منصوبًا؛</span> 100 takes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفردًا مجرورًا بالإضافة</span>. The role of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span> itself depends on its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثةُ كتابًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثةُ كتبٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثةُ كتبًا</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون كتبٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون كتابٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون كتابًا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائةُ كتبًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائةُ كتابٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائةُ كتابًا</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "8G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Ask how many days: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم <span class=\"blank\"></span> لبثتَ؟</span></b>", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم الاستفهامية</span> here takes a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد تمييز منصوب: يومًا. كم</span> asks for the number; it does not itself mean “many.”</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيامُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يومٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يومًا</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "8I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الخبرية</span> meaning “Many a book I have read”: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم قرأتُ <span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b>.", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span> is separated from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم</span>, so the taught rule requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من الظاهرة. كتابٍ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بمن</span>.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز كم الخبرية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من كتابٍ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "8I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ عدّة الشهور ... اثنا عشر شهرًا</span></b>, why can <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شهرًا</span> be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييزًا</span> despite <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشهور</span> already being mentioned?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span> can reinforce information rather than remove fresh <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إبهام. شهرًا</span> still has the number construction’s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span> role.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد يكون التمييز مؤكّدًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شهرًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل إنّ</span>", "Every repeated meaning becomes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حالًا</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "8R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكثتُ ثلاثةَ أيامٍ</span></b>, distinguish the roles.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثةَ</span> states the duration and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف؛ أيامٍ</span> supplies the counted unit and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالإضافة</span>. Not all words in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span> chapter are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span>.</p>", "group": "8R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثةَ فاعل؛ أيامٍ مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثةَ نائب عن ظرف الزمان؛ أيامٍ مضاف إليه وهو تمييز العدد في المعنى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيامٍ منصوب بكسرة لأنه حال</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "8-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد يكون التمييز مجرورًا</span>.</b> Select the example.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سنةٍ</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد مجرور</span> following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف. يومًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راكبًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> rather than <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون يومًا: يومًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء راكبًا: راكبًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألفُ سنةٍ: سنةٍ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "9", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاستثناء</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلّا</span>", "short": "Lesson 9", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s1\">Identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أركان</span> first</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاستثناء</span></b> removes something from the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حكم</span> of what precedes. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء القومُ إلّا زيدًا</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القوم</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستثنى منه</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ إلّا</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أداة الاستثناء</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ زيدًا</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستثنى</span></b>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تام، غير مفرّغ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستثنى منه</span> is expressed. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير تام، مفرّغ</span></b>: it is absent, after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه نفي</span>. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرّغ, إلّا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أداة حصر لا تعمل</span>; the earlier <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> governs the following expression: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما جاء إلّا خالدٌ؛ ما رأيتُ إلّا خالدًا؛ ما مررتُ إلّا بخالدٍ</span></b>.</p><p>In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تام</span>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متصل</span></b> means that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستثنى</span> belongs to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جنس</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستثنى منه</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منقطع</span></b> means it does not; it corrects a possible impression of inclusion, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلّا بمعنى لكن للاستدراك</span>. It is not a licence to append any unrelated word.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> and endings</h2><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستثنى منه</span> must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة مفيدة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء القوم ...؛ ما جاء أحد</span> ...</b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستثنى</span> must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة مخصوصة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلّا زيدًا؛ إلّا رجلًا مريضًا؛ إلّا رجلَ سوءٍ</span></b>. Under this account, a bare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء قومٌ إلّا خالدًا</span></b> lacks the required <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span>, and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء القوم إلّا رجلًا</span></b> leaves <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستثنى</span> insufficiently specified.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Construction with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلّا</span></th><th>Rule</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تام متصل موجب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب المستثنى: جاء الطلابُ إلّا خالدًا</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تام متصل غير موجب, المستثنى</span> follows</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل: ما جاء الطلابُ إلّا خالدًا / خالدٌ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستثنى</span> precedes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستثنى منه</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب: ما جاء إلّا خالدًا الطلابُ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرّغ</span></td><td>The preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> determines the role</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منقطع</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> in the main account used here</td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موجب</span></b> has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه نفي</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير موجب</span></b> includes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي</span> and settings such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نهي</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span></b> follows the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> of its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبدل منه</span>; it is understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على نية طرح المبدل منه</span>. Thus <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما جاء الطلاب إلا خالدٌ</span></b> is comparable to <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما جاء إلا خالدٌ</span></b> for this relationship, although the expressed first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تامًّا</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَا جَاءَ الطُّلَّابُ إِلَّا خَالِدٌ</span>.</b> Use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البدل</span>.</p><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما: حرف نفي؛ جاء: فعل ماض</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلابُ: فاعل مرفوع بالضمة، وهو المستثنى منه</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلّا: أداة استثناء؛ خالدٌ: بدل من الطلاب، مرفوع بالضمة</span>.</li></ul><p>Changing to <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span></b> is valid with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب على الاستثناء</span>. It is not the requested <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> analysis. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما جاء إلّا خالدٌ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> is directly <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدلًا من</span> an expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلاب</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L9-s1", "title": "Identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أركان</span> first"}, {"id": "L9-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> and endings"}, {"id": "L9-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "9G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أركان</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر الطلابُ إلّا خالدًا</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلاب</span> is the expressed whole; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلّا</span> introduces exclusion; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span> is removed from the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حكم</span> of attendance. The construction is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تام متصل موجب</span>.</p>", "group": "9G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلاب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستثنى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أداة الاستثناء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستثنى منه</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلّا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أداة الاستثناء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستثنى منه</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل حضر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستثنى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "9G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البدل</span></b> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما حضر الطلابُ إلّا خالد<span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b>.", "sol": "<p>As <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلابُ, خالدٌ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع. خالدًا</span> would be valid <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب على الاستثناء</span>, but that is not the selected analysis.</p>", "group": "9G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٍ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "9I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر الإعراب في الاستثناء المفرّغ</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستثنى منه</span> is absent. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلّا للحصر لا تعمل؛ فاز</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل، قابلت</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به،</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ</span>.</p>", "group": "9I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما فاز إلا سليم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سليمٌ: فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سليمًا: مستثنى منصوب وجوبًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سليمٍ: مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما قابلت إلا سليما</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سليمٍ: مجرور بإلّا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سليمًا: مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سليمٌ: فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما مررت إلا بسليم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سليمٍ: مجرور بالباء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سليمًا: منصوب بإلّا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سليمٌ: خبر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "9I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تام</span> construction with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستثنى مقدّم</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما جاء إلّا <span class=\"blank\"></span> الطلابُ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستثنى</span> precedes the expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستثنى منه</span>, so use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>. Do not treat this as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرّغ</span> while ignoring <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلاب</span>.</p>", "group": "9I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ على البدل المؤخّر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "9R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which statement about <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما جاء الطلاب إلا خالدٌ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما جاء إلا خالدٌ</span></b> is correct?", "sol": "<p>The first retains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلاب</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ومُستثنى منه</span>. The second is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرّغ</span>, so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> is directly <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل جاء</span>.</p>", "group": "9R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلّا ترفع خالدًا في كلتيهما</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ بدل في الأولى وفاعل في الثانية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ بدل في كلتيهما</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "9-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في الاستثناء المفرّغ لا تعمل إلّا</span>.</b> What determines <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسالةً</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما كتبتُ إلّا رسالةً</span></b>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتب</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسالة</span> as what was written. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلّا</span> supplies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حصر</span> without assigning the ending.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسالة</span> is necessarily <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبتُ: رسالةً مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلّا: كل ما بعدها منصوب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "10", "title": "Other <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أدوات الاستثناء</span> and special readings", "short": "Lesson 10", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s1\">Keep the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أداة</span> and its following word separate</h2><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أداة</span></th><th>Treatment</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلا، عدا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span> in the predominant account; some use them as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرفا جر</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما خلا، ما عدا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span>; the following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاشا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر للاستثناء مع التنزيه</span> in this account</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير، سوى</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء</span>; what follows is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس، لا يكون</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span> used in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاستثناء</span>; identify the following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> through the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناقص</span> construction</td></tr></tbody></table><p>With verbal <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلا / عدا</span></b>, the following word is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span> and a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر</span> is understood as referring to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستثنى منه</span>. An alternative treats the expression as equivalent to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلّا</span> without assigning a separate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ومفعول</span>; use the verbal account in practice unless told otherwise. With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس / لا يكون</span></b>, the following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>, not an ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل تام</span>.</p><p>In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاستثناء</span>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير</span></b> takes the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> that the corresponding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستثنى</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلّا</span> would have. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء الطلابُ غيرَ خالدٍ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غيرَ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٍ مجرور بالإضافة</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما جاء غيرُ خالدٍ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غيرُ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل. سوى</span> likewise requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>; its ending is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدّر على الألف</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s2\">Nuances in reading</h2><p>For <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المنقطع</span>, the main account uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>. Other recognised accounts allow <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير الموجب</span> in a particular usage, or give <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلّا عمل لكنّ</span>, with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> and an expressed or omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>. Recognise these as alternatives; do not combine their labels into one <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير</span></b> ordinarily describes: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيوتًا غيرَ بيوتكم</span></b>. It can also introduce <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء</span>. Conversely <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلّا</span></b> may describe <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمعنى غير</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لو كان فيهما آلهةٌ إلّا اللهُ لفسدتا</span></b>. Here the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span> specifies “gods other than Allah”; both the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> and the intended meaning require the descriptive account rather than ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تام موجب استثناء</span>.</p><p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا إله إلّا الله</span></b>, recognised analyses include a rearranged <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ وخبر</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحصر</span>, or a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تام غير موجب</span> construction with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر محذوف</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الله بدل</span> from the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير المستتر</span> in that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>. Do not simply label <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الله خبر لا: خبر لا لنفي الجنس</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span> in this account.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللهمّ إلّا</span></b> can signal the rarity of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يغيب هذا الرجل عن الصفّ الأول، اللهمّ إلّا أن يكون مريضًا</span></b>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حَضَرَ الطُّلَّابُ مَا عَدَا خَالِدًا</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">The students attended except Khalid.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر: فعل ماض؛ الطلابُ: فاعل مرفوع</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما: مصدرية؛ عدا: فعل ماض جامد للاستثناء، مبني على الفتح المقدّر على الألف؛ فاعله ضمير مستتر</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا: مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة لعدا</span>.</li></ul><p>Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر الطلاب غيرَ خالدٍ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير منصوب على الاستثناء وهو مضاف؛ خالد مضاف إليه مجرور</span>. The meaning is similar, but the immediate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> changes.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L10-s1", "title": "Keep the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أداة</span> and its following word separate"}, {"id": "L10-s2", "title": "Nuances in reading"}, {"id": "L10-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "10G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each stated construction.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما عدا</span> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل؛ غير</span> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة؛ حاشا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span> in the account adopted here. Similar exclusion meanings do not give identical <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>.</p>", "group": "10G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما عدا خالدًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا اسم عدا الناقصة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا مجرور بما</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا مفعول به لعدا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غيرَ خالدٍ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٍ مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٍ فاعل مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٍ منصوب بإلّا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاشا الأنبياءِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأنبياءَ مفعول مطلق</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأنبياءُ فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأنبياءِ مجرور بحاشا في التحليل المعتمد</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "10G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر الطلابُ غيرَ <span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غيرَ</span> receives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب على الاستثناء؛ سعيدٍ</span> receives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ الإضافة</span>. Do not transfer the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير</span> to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "10G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "10I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما فاز غيرُ سليمٍ</span></b>, identify both roles.", "sol": "<p>With no expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستثنى منه, فاز</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غيرُ</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرورًا بالإضافة</span>.</p>", "group": "10I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غيرُ فاعل وهو مضاف؛ سليمٍ مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غيرُ مستثنى منصوب؛ سليمٍ فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير حرف جر؛ سليم مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "10I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct: “<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلا</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما خلا</span> must always be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حروف جر</span>.”", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما خلا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعلية</span> in the stated classification. Without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما, خلا</span> is predominantly treated as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>, with a recognised <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span> alternative.</p>", "group": "10I|Independent", "opts": ["Correct: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span> prevents verbal analysis.", "Both must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء مضافة</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما خلا فعل؛ خلا</span> permits the verbal account and a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span> account."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "10R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In the descriptive reading <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لو كان فيهما آلهةٌ إلّا اللهُ لفسدتا</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلّا</span> means:", "sol": "<p>The intended sense is “gods other than Allah.” The stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> and meaning support the descriptive account, not ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب المستثنى</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تام موجب</span>.</p>", "group": "10R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير، لتقييد آلهة بالصفة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أداة استثناء تام موجب توجب نصب الله</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر يجرّ الله</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "10-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما بعد غير مجرور بالإضافة</span>.</b> Does this force <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير</span> itself to be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرورًا</span>?", "sol": "<p>Separate the outer role of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير</span> from its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> relationship. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غيرُ</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما جاء غير خالد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["No: its own role may be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستثنى</span>, for example.", "Yes: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير</span> is itself <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>.", "Yes: both words always have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ</span>."], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "11", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر منصوب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم منصوب</span>?", "short": "Lesson 11", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L11-s1\">Identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> before its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span></h2><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span></th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الناقصة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمها</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبرها</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان خالدٌ حاضرًا</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحروف المشبهة بليس</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمها</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبرها</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما هذا بشرًا</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحروف المشبهة بالفعل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبرها</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمها</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ اللهَ رحيمٌ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Recall <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان وأخواتها</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ، أنّ، كأنّ، لكنّ، ليت، لعلّ</span></b>. The shared <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> does not make <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ</span> a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>, or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر كان</span> a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L11-s2\">Position and prerequisites</h2><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر كان</span> may precede <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمها</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس سواءً عالمٌ وجهولٌ</span></b>. It may also precede the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قائمًا كان زيدٌ</span></b>. Do not move it before a preceding <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما المصدرية</span></b> or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما النافية</span></b>: these require <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصدارة</span>. This restriction concerns crossing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span>, not a blanket ban on every possible internal rearrangement.</p><p>For <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما المشبهة بليس</span></b>, use its working construction: no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن الزائدة</span> cancelling its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span>, no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلّا</span> cancelling the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي</span>, and the ordinary order <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ثم خبر</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما خالدٌ غائبًا</span></b> with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما خالدٌ إلّا معلّمٌ</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا المشبهة بليس</span></b> works with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرتين</span> in the stated order: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا شيءٌ مشابهًا لله</span></b>. Do not confuse this with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا لنفي الجنس</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لات</span></b> is used with time expressions and normally omits one of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمها وخبرها</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ولات حينَ مناصٍ</span></b>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> understood and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حينَ خبر منصوب</span>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> is an added <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء للتأكيد</span>; it is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء الفاعل</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L11-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إِنَّ خَالِدًا كَانَ حَاضِرًا</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Khalid was present.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ: حرف مشبّه بالفعل؛ خالدًا: اسم إنّ منصوب بالفتحة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان: فعل ماض ناقص؛ اسمها ضمير مستتر تقديره هو يعود إلى خالد</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاضرًا: خبر كان منصوب بالفتحة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة كان حاضرًا: في محل رفع خبر إنّ</span>.</li></ul><p>The final word is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> inside a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> whose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>. Keep these two levels separate.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L11-s1", "title": "Identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> before its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span>"}, {"id": "L11-s2", "title": "Position and prerequisites"}, {"id": "L11-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "11G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> to its role.", "sol": "<p>Each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> has a distinct pattern of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل. كان</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما المشبهة بليس</span> have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر منصوب</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم منصوب</span>.</p>", "group": "11G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان خالدٌ حاضرًا: حاضرًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال واجبًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم كان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر كان</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ خالدًا حاضرٌ: خالدًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما هذا بشرًا: بشرًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ما المشبهة بليس</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز عدد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ما</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "11G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the permitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ترتيب</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر كان</span> may precede <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان</span>. The specified rule prevents moving it before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما النافية</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما المصدرية</span> in the other two options.</p>", "group": "11G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاضرًا كان خالدٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاضرًا ما زال خالدٌ</span> under the rule forbidding crossing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما النافية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاضرًا ما دام خالدٌ</span> under the rule forbidding crossing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما المصدرية</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "11I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ سليمًا كان <span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعبًا خبر كان منصوب؛ اسم كان ضمير مستتر هو</span>. The whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة كان متعبًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع خبر إنّ</span>.</p>", "group": "11I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعبٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعبٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعبًا</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "11I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct the ending in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما خالدٌ إلّا غائبًا</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلّا</span> cancels the working <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي شرط</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما المشبهة بليس</span>. Use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد مبتدأ وغائب خبر مرفوع</span> in this construction.</p>", "group": "11I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غائبًا</span> must remain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ما العاملة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غائبٌ: خبر مرفوع بعد انتقاض النفي بإلّا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غائبٍ: مجرور بإلّا</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "11R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالدٌ متعبًا</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان خالدٌ متعبًا</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل تام</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعبًا</span> describes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هيئة</span> its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل. كان</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناقص</span> and requires its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>, so the identical word has a different role.</p>", "group": "11R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعبًا حال في كلتيهما</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعبًا مفعول به في كلتيهما</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعبًا حال في الأولى وخبر كان في الثانية</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "11-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يتقدّم الخبر على ما المصدرية أو النافية</span>.</b> What is the stated boundary?", "sol": "<p>The restriction names <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span> because of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصدارة</span>. It does not erase the permission exemplified by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قائمًا كان زيدٌ</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["No <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> may ever precede any <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ناقص</span>.", "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>.", "Do not move the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> to a position before those forms of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span>."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "12", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا لنفي الجنس</span>", "short": "Lesson 12", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L12-s1\">Core rule and prerequisites</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا لنفي الجنس</span></b> excludes the whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جنس</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا طالبَ في البيتِ</span></b>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرتان</span> in the working construction; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> immediately follows it. If a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span> follows, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span> is repeated and does not give that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة نصب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا خالدٌ حاضرٌ ولا سعيدٌ</span></b>. Recall that separation also prevents the ordinary direct <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا في البيت رجلٌ ولا امرأةٌ</span></b>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L12-s2\">Three forms of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا</span></h2><table><thead><tr><th>Form</th><th>Treatment</th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب لفظًا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا طالبَ علمٍ غائبٌ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبيه بالمضاف: عامل فيما بعده</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب لفظًا</span>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> where appropriate</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا عاصيًا أمَّه وأباه ناجحٌ</span></td></tr><tr><td>Neither</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني في محل نصب</span> in the adopted account</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا رجلَ؛ لا رجالَ؛ لا رجلينِ؛ لا مسلمينَ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>In this chapter <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد</span></b> often means “neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> nor <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبيه بالمضاف</span>”; it can therefore include <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنى</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span>. For this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span> form: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفرد وجمع التكسير</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنيان على الفتح؛ المثنى وجمع المذكر السالم على الياء؛ جمع المؤنث السالم</span> permits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البناء على الفتح أو الكسر</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا مسلماتَ / لا مسلماتِ</span></b>. Neither form here has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span>. An alternative account treats these as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب منصوب</span>; use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البناء</span> in the questions.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L12-s3\">Repeated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span>: five patterns</h2><p>With the two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء</span> immediately following repeated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span>, these five combinations are allowed:</p><table><thead><tr><th>First</th><th>Second</th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على الفتح</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على الفتح</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا حولَ ولا قوّةَ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على الفتح</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا حولَ ولا قوّةٌ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على الفتح</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا حولَ ولا قوّةً</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا حولٌ ولا قوّةٌ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على الفتح</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا حولٌ ولا قوّةَ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Distinguish <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قوّةَ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبنية</span> from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قوّةً</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعربة المنصوبة</span>. Do not invent a sixth pattern <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع الأول ونصب الثاني</span> from this list. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا الناصبة</span> conveys <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span> not supplied by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا المهملة</span>. Questions specify the pattern, so they do not mark another permitted pattern wrong merely for differing.</p><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا</span> can be omitted when understood: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا عليك</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا بأسَ عليك</span></b>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> is also often omitted when a general meaning such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موجود</span> is recoverable.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L12-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَا طَالِبَ عِلْمٍ غَائِبٌ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">No seeker of knowledge is absent.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا: نافية للجنس تعمل عمل إنّ</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبَ: اسم لا منصوب بالفتحة لأنه مضاف</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علمٍ: مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غائبٌ: خبر لا مرفوع بالضمة</span>.</li></ul><p>Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا طالبَ غائبٌ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبَ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح في محل نصب</span>, because it is neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> nor <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبيه بالمضاف</span>. Identical visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span>, different account.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L12-s1", "title": "Core rule and prerequisites"}, {"id": "L12-s2", "title": "Three forms of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا</span>"}, {"id": "L12-s3", "title": "Repeated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span>: five patterns"}, {"id": "L12-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "12G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Use the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البناء</span> account for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا غير المضاف ولا الشبيه بالمضاف</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالب علم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة؛ عاصيًا</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمّه</span> and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبيه بالمضاف؛ طالب</span> in the third is neither. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غائبٌ</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر لا</span>.</p>", "group": "12G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا طالبَ علمٍ غائبٌ: طالب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا منصوب لأنه مضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا مبني لأنه مضاف</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا عاصيًا أمَّه ناجحٌ: عاصيًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا مبني بلا تنوين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا منصوب لأنه شبيه بالمضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا طالبَ غائبٌ: طالب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إلى غائب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح في محل نصب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "12G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء الاسمين على الفتح</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا حول<span class=\"blank\"></span> ولا قوّة<span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b>.", "sol": "<p>The selected pattern builds both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء على الفتح</span> without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span>. The other forms are valid under different patterns, not the requested one.</p>", "group": "12G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا حولَ ولا قوّةً</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا حولَ ولا قوّةَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا حولٌ ولا قوّةٌ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "12I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر التحليل المعتمد في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا معلّمينَ في البيت</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمين</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع مذكر سالم</span>, neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> nor <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبيه بالمضاف</span> here. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الياء في محل نصب</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في البيت</span> supplies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر لا</span>.</p>", "group": "12I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمينَ: خبر لا منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمينَ: اسم لا مبني على الياء في محل نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمينَ: مضاف إليه مجرور</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "12I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which pair of endings is absent from the five permitted patterns taught here?", "sol": "<p>The five patterns include <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء/بناء، بناء/رفع، بناء/نصب، رفع/رفع، رفع/بناء. رفع/نصب</span> is not among them.</p>", "group": "12I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع الأول ونصب الثاني: لا حولٌ ولا قوّةً</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء الأول ورفع الثاني: لا حولَ ولا قوّةٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع الأول وبناء الثاني: لا حولٌ ولا قوّةَ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "12R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا طالبَ علمٍ غائبٌ</span></b>, choose the complete set.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> makes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبَ معربًا منصوبًا</span> in this account. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علمٍ</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ الإضافة</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غائبٌ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر لا مرفوع</span>.</p>", "group": "12R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبَ حال؛ علمٍ فاعل؛ غائبٌ مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبَ اسم لا منصوب؛ علمٍ مضاف إليه؛ غائبٌ خبر لا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبَ مبني لأنه مضاف؛ علمٍ خبر لا</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "12-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا المضاف والشبيه بالمضاف منصوبان لفظًا</span>.</b> Which expression has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمًا شبيهًا بالمضاف</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عاصيًا</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أباه</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>, making it <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبيهًا بالمضاف. طالب علم</span> is actual <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل</span> is neither.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا رجلَ في البيت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا عاصيًا أباه ناجحٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا طالبَ علمٍ غائبٌ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "R", "title": "Module review: distinguish the relationships", "short": "Module review", "html": "<p>Read the passages first. Then identify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العامل، المعمول، العلاقة، الإعراب وعلامته</span>. The final questions provide less English support.</p>", "secs": [], "items": [{"id": "A1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> in the specified examples.", "sol": "<p>Track the questions answered: what was memorised; the action itself; its duration; the motive; and accompaniment. All five have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> but different relationships.</p>", "group": "A|Distinctions and conditions", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حفظتُ الدرسَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اجتهدتُ اجتهادًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">انتظرتُ ساعةً</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول معه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول فيه</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قمتُ احترامًا للمعلّم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستثنى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر كان</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سرتُ والنهرَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول معه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "A2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر الوصف الصحيح</span>.", "sol": "<p>The presence of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلاب</span> makes the last two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تامّين. ما</span> makes the second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير موجب</span>. In the first the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> seeks <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> directly.</p>", "group": "A|Distinctions and conditions", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما جاء إلا خالدٌ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تام موجب؛ خالد مستثنى منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد بدل من مذكور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء مفرّغ؛ خالد فاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما جاء الطلاب إلا خالدٌ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تام غير موجب؛ خالد بدل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرّغ؛ خالد فاعل جاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد خبر إنّ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء الطلاب إلا خالدًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرّغ؛ خالد فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تام متصل موجب؛ نصب المستثنى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "B1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكمل بحسب التحليل المحدّد</span>.", "sol": "<p>Twenty takes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفردًا منصوبًا. غير</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالب</span> in these examples are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضافان</span>, so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">درس</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علم</span> receive <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ</span>.</p>", "group": "B|Endings and error correction", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأت عشرين <span class=\"blank\"></span>: كتاب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٍ: مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبًا: جمع منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا: تمييز</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرت الدروس غيرَ <span class=\"blank\"></span>: درس</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">درسًا: مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">درسٍ: مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">درسٌ: فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا طالبَ <span class=\"blank\"></span> غائبٌ: علم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علمٌ: اسم لا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علمًا: حال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علمٍ: مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "B2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحّح</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالدٌ يضحكَ، لأن جملة يضحك حال</span>.</b>", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> does not replace the internal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> of its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>. No <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جازم</span> precedes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يضحك</span>.</p>", "group": "B|Endings and error correction", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يضحكْ مجزوم لأن الحال نكرة</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يضحكُ مرفوع، والجملة في محل نصب حال</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا منصوب لأن بعده حال</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "C1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Read: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصل سليم صباحا. جلس خلف الباب ساعة. ثم قرأ الدرس قراءة دقيقة</span>.</b> Match the roles, restoring endings.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سليمٌ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل وصل</span>. The later <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span> have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر هو</span> returning to him. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صباحًا</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساعةً</span> give time; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلفَ</span> gives place; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرسَ</span> is what he reads; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءةً دقيقةً</span> specifies the kind of reading.</p>", "group": "C|Connected reading and full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صباحا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صباحًا: ظرف زمان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صباحٍ: مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صباحٌ: فاعل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلف الباب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلفِ مجرور بلا عامل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلفُ فاعل؛ البابَ مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلفَ ظرف مكان؛ البابِ مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساعة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساعةٌ: فاعل جلس</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساعةٍ: مجرور بخلف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساعةً: ظرف زمان</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرس</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرسِ: مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرسُ: فاعل قرأ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرسَ: مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءة دقيقة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول معه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءةٌ فاعل؛ دقيقةٌ خبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءةً مفعول مطلق للنوع؛ دقيقةً نعت</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "C2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Full <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ سليمًا قرأ الدرسَ جالسًا</span>.</b> Take <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جالسًا</span> as describing the reader.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سليمًا</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمها</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبرها</span>. Inside that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة, قرأ</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر هو</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل؛ الدرس مفعول به؛ جالسًا حال من ذلك الضمير، عامله قرأ</span>. The internal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> does not change the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>’s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع</span>.</p>", "group": "C|Connected reading and full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مشبّه بالفعل، لا محل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ناقص</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سليمًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل قرأ مقدّم في التحليل المطلوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ منصوب بالفتحة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على الفتح</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل قرأ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مستتر هو يعود إلى سليم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا فاعل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرس</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرسَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ ثان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال منصوب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جالسًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز عدد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال منصوب من الضمير المستتر في قرأ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة قرأ الدرس جالسًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب اسم إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع خبر إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "C3", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اقرأ</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر الطلاب إلا سليما. كان سليم مريضا. لا طالب علم مهمل</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حلّل الجملة الأخيرة كاملة</span>.", "sol": "<p>Read <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر الطلابُ إلّا سليمًا؛ كان سليمٌ مريضًا؛ لا طالبَ علمٍ مهملٌ</span>. The last <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا مضافًا</span>, so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب لفظًا</span>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوعًا</span>.</p>", "group": "C|Connected reading and full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي للجنس يعمل عمل إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا الناهية تجزم طالب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبَ: مبني لأنه مضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبُ: فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبَ: اسم لا منصوب بالفتحة، وهو مضاف</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علمًا: تمييز</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علمٌ: خبر لا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علمٍ: مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مهمل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مهملٍ: مضاف إليه ثان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مهملٌ: خبر لا مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مهملًا: خبر لا منصوب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "D1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اتحاد الفاعل والزمن من شروط نصب المفعول له بلا لام</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر التطبيق</span>.", "sol": "<p>The first has the same person and time for the action and inward motive. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحجّ</span> fails the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلبي شرط</span>, and earlier <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رحمة</span> fails the shared time <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>.</p>", "group": "D|Read Arabic grammatical language", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قمتُ إكرامًا للمعلّم</span>: I rose while intending to honour him.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سافرتُ الحجَّ: الحجّ</span> is automatically <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلبي</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أرحمه رحمتَه إيّاي صغيرًا</span>: different times never matter."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "D2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد يكون التمييز مجرورًا، وقد يكون الحال لازمًا</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر المثالين الموافقين</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سنةٍ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز العدد مجرور بالإضافة؛ ضعيفًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال لازمة</span>. The statement explicitly warns against equating <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التمييز</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> in every instance or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال</span> with change in every instance.</p>", "group": "D|Read Arabic grammatical language", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سرتُ والنهرَ؛ قرأتُ الدرسَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألفُ سنةٍ؛ خُلق الإنسانُ ضعيفًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون كتابًا؛ جاء راكبًا</span> as examples of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لزوم</span>"], "ans": 1}], "after": "<h2 class=\"sec\">Ready to continue?</h2><p>You should be able to distinguish the five <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفاعيل</span>, identify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب الحال</span>, explain what <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التمييز</span> clarifies, choose the appropriate account of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاستثناء</span>, and separate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم الناسخ</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبره</span>. If an ending fits several roles, return to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> and meaning rather than guessing from the vowel.</p>"}], "revisit": "<ul><li>The five <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفاعيل</span>: Lessons 1–4.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال</span> and its classifications: Lessons 5–6.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التمييز</span>, numbers and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم</span>: Lessons 7–8.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاستثناء</span> and alternative analyses: Lessons 9–10.</li><li>Names, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النواسخ</span>: Lessons 11–12.</li></ul>"};
